      Title: Give me the plan.
      PauseGameplayWhileReading: 1
      Lines:
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName:
        Text: First, check the lander's air supply and power. Then restore whatever water recycling equipment we can use in the colony. Until then, we will keep you alive with the facilities that still work.
