        CustomColor:
          R: 0.65
          G: 1
          B: 0.76
          A: 1
        WaitForContinue: 1
        DelayAfter: 0.5
      - Speaker: 0
        DisplayName:
        Text: After that, repair the greenhouse and check the seed reserves. Emergency rations are not enough. We need to start producing food.
